Not included in this release
-----------------------------
Stage 9 (plugins, WebView2 plugin host, Info.json, plugin permissions) and
Stage 10 (online subtitles/OpenSubtitles, yt-dlp integration) were intentionally
skipped by the maintainer. This release contains no plugin host, no WebView2
runtime dependency, no online-subtitle client, and no yt-dlp invocation. The
corresponding settings rows and menu entries are visibly disabled and explain
that the feature is not implemented. No WebView2, yt-dlp, OpenSubtitles or
plugin code is shipped, so no additional permissions or third-party terms apply
to this release.

